# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the op-fusion programme's four-card window, WP6's own jobs (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/fusion-1 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. WP6/ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1 is the placeholder for the tag the pack's B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-fusion-1/<tag>/' *.env). The cards are
# under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# WS1 (EXACTNESS): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-wp6-singles = the audited lean twin plus ALL FOUR WP6 levers and ALL FOUR of their audits
# (QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_REDUCE, _TAIL, _GATEUP1, _MM_GRID and each _AUDIT). Every lever compares itself with the served composition on the device on the warm pass of each
# drafter bucket (eager, on real activations and weights: five layers' chains), and the draft-singles audit compares the batched quad draft with each user's own single
# draft in the same round. READ: c2_smoke_check clean; python3 scripts/ci/draft_wp6_smoke.py --log <container log> --profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-
# levern-w2-er-fx-wp6-singles (clean: every lever engaged, no fell-back line, at least one 'audit <n> exact=True' line per lever, no 'audit mismatch'); the answers'
# hashes equal to WS0's, user by user (any difference is NO-GO); ZERO mismatches of the other audits. ANY mismatch or fall-back is NO-GO for the lever it names and skips
# WTC1..WTL2 until it is out of the arm. Duration (estimate): 55 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-wp6-singles
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent8_code_32k
